    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Gaung</i>\u00a0['g\u016bh-\u00fcng] - A repeated sound caused by the reflection of a sound wave&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But when the voice returns distorted, maybe it's not answering your voice, it's calling you back!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gaung is a short and immersive horror adventure that plunges players into the eerie depths of an ancient cave, rumored to be haunted by forgotten energies and lingering shadows of the past. As Rani, a young woman who agrees to a midnight exploration of the infamous Gaung Cave at her friend\u2019s request, players will uncover secrets of lost rituals, forbidden sacrifices, and unsettling apparitions. What begins as a thrill-seeking journey soon spirals into a chilling nightmare, as Rani finds herself trapped and forced to unravel the cave\u2019s dark past to survive.  <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3322740/extras/aa8060d198b8bc75fadb95970afc07f5.poster.avif?t=1733590254\" width=608 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3322740/extras/aa8060d198b8bc75fadb95970afc07f5.webm?t=1733590254\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3322740/extras/aa8060d198b8bc75fadb95970afc07f5.mp4?t=1733590254\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chilling Atmosphere:</strong> Explore haunting caves and mysterious passageways with carefully crafted lighting and soundscapes to evoke real, spine-tingling horror.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intriguing Storyline:</strong> Uncover the sinister secrets of Gaung Cave, rooted in legends of ancient rites and untold sacrifices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzles and Survival Mechanics:</strong> Solve intricate puzzles and use survival strategies as you navigate dark corridors, recover helpful items like flashlights and ancient clues, and escape relentless entities that haunt the cave's shadows.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3322740/extras/3ac8ef8a17f5de035085fd7fc69214fe.poster.avif?t=1733590254\" width=608 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3322740/extras/3ac8ef8a17f5de035085fd7fc69214fe.webm?t=1733590254\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3322740/extras/3ac8ef8a17f5de035085fd7fc69214fe.mp4?t=1733590254\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Will you survive the echoes of Gaung?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Gaung</i>\u00a0['g\u016bh-\u00fcng] - A repeated sound caused by the reflection of a sound wave&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But when the voice returns distorted, maybe it's not answering your voice, it's calling you back!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gaung is a short and immersive horror adventure that plunges players into the eerie depths of an ancient cave, rumored to be haunted by forgotten energies and lingering shadows of the past. As Rani, a young woman who agrees to a midnight exploration of the infamous Gaung Cave at her friend\u2019s request, players will uncover secrets of lost rituals, forbidden sacrifices, and unsettling apparitions. What begins as a thrill-seeking journey soon spirals into a chilling nightmare, as Rani finds herself trapped and forced to unravel the cave\u2019s dark past to survive.  <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3322740/extras/aa8060d198b8bc75fadb95970afc07f5.poster.avif?t=1733590254\" width=608 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3322740/extras/aa8060d198b8bc75fadb95970afc07f5.webm?t=1733590254\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3322740/extras/aa8060d198b8bc75fadb95970afc07f5.mp4?t=1733590254\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chilling Atmosphere:</strong> Explore haunting caves and mysterious passageways with carefully crafted lighting and soundscapes to evoke real, spine-tingling horror.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intriguing Storyline:</strong> Uncover the sinister secrets of Gaung Cave, rooted in legends of ancient rites and untold sacrifices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzles and Survival Mechanics:</strong> Solve intricate puzzles and use survival strategies as you navigate dark corridors, recover helpful items like flashlights and ancient clues, and escape relentless entities that haunt the cave's shadows.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3322740/extras/3ac8ef8a17f5de035085fd7fc69214fe.poster.avif?t=1733590254\" width=608 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3322740/extras/3ac8ef8a17f5de035085fd7fc69214fe.webm?t=1733590254\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3322740/extras/3ac8ef8a17f5de035085fd7fc69214fe.mp4?t=1733590254\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Will you survive the echoes of Gaung?</p>",
